WEBVTT

video-title-preparation
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Okweteekateeka

hygiene
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Naaba engalo, oyambale eby'okwekuuma.

equipment
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Weetaaga gauze, ppamba, kaadi, ekkalaamu, ekikopo, teepu ne makansi.

video-title-eye-pad
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Okukola ppamba y'eriiso

cotton
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Okukola ppamba y'eriiso, yanjuza akapiira ka ppamba mu ngeri ey'ekigi, nga kagazi sentimita ttaano oba mukaaga.

gauze
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Zinga gauze ku ppamba.

pad-tape
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Teeka teepu ku nkomerero enzigule.

trim
00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Salako empenda za gauze nga ogoberera enkula ya ppamba.

finished-pad
00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:05.000
Eno ye ppamba y'eriiso.

video-title-eye-shield
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Okukola ekikuumi ky'eriiso

cardboard
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:19.000
Ku kikuumi, funa kaadi ennyonjo. Osobola okuddamu okukozesa ekipaketi ky'eddagala.

draw
00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:33.000
Kozesa ekikopo ng'ekyokulabirako, okube ekikulungo ekigazi nga sentimita munaana.

cut
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:46.000
Salayo ekikulungo.

slit
00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:53.000
Oluvannyuma sala okuva ku ludda okutuuka wakati.

cone
00:01:53.000 --> 00:02:04.000
Zinga kaadi ekole ekifunvu, oginyweze ne teepu.

finished-shield
00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:14.000
Kino kye kikuumi ky'eriiso.
